{"2607570": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Foosball Manager", "steam_appid": 2607570, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Foosball Manager is table football, but the players think for themselves. You don't spin the rods — you run the club: scout players, set the tactics, and watch every match play out on a fully physics-driven table. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deep enough to obsess over every detail, casual enough to pick up in minutes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2607570/extras/b285f52e0cc185a8c3e27bdc3d1d52c9.poster.avif?t=1780324963\" width=1170 height=366 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2607570/extras/b285f52e0cc185a8c3e27bdc3d1d52c9.webm?t=1780324963\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2607570/extras/b285f52e0cc185a8c3e27bdc3d1d52c9.mp4?t=1780324963\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >You manage. The table decides.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set your game plan, prepare your starting line-up, then adjust from the sideline as the match unfolds. Nothing is predetermined — every result is earned.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make substitutions and change tactics mid-match</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players act on their own, driven by their attributes, form, and morale</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Opponents bring their own tactics, so every match demands a different approach</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2607570/extras/c1652c9ec9bf37cf7225e27141f7b30e.poster.avif?t=1780324963\" width=1170 height=420 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2607570/extras/c1652c9ec9bf37cf7225e27141f7b30e.webm?t=1780324963\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2607570/extras/c1652c9ec9bf37cf7225e27141f7b30e.mp4?t=1780324963\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Players with real depth</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every player has strengths and weaknesses, both on and off the pitch. Attributes like accuracy, vision, power, speed, and composure make each player feel unique.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scout the transfer market for wonderkids from different countries</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sign players with the right traits and strengths for your squad</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build chemistry between the players you sign</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2607570/extras/18df219aca1db8bfa5e0498b8a4e9156.poster.avif?t=1780324963\" width=1170 height=520 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2607570/extras/18df219aca1db8bfa5e0498b8a4e9156.webm?t=1780324963\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2607570/extras/18df219aca1db8bfa5e0498b8a4e9156.mp4?t=1780324963\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Climb the ranks</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take a no-name club up through the divisions, season after season.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >12 leagues to choose from, each with divisions to climb</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Invest in your youth academy to develop future stars and build a club that lasts</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Qualify for continental cups and become a foosball legend</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2607570/extras/41a7db550b29e1d14acec99535cf19b3.poster.avif?t=1780324963\" width=1170 height=520 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2607570/extras/41a7db550b29e1d14acec99535cf19b3.webm?t=1780324963\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2607570/extras/41a7db550b29e1d14acec99535cf19b3.mp4?t=1780324963\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A singleplayer management sim — <strong>wishlist now</strong> to get notified at launch.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Foosball Manager is table football, but the players think for themselves. You don't spin the rods — you run the club: scout players, set the tactics, and watch every match play out on a fully physics-driven table. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deep enough to obsess over every detail, casual enough to pick up in minutes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2607570/extras/b285f52e0cc185a8c3e27bdc3d1d52c9.poster.avif?t=1780324963\" width=1170 height=366 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2607570/extras/b285f52e0cc185a8c3e27bdc3d1d52c9.webm?t=1780324963\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2607570/extras/b285f52e0cc185a8c3e27bdc3d1d52c9.mp4?t=1780324963\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >You manage. The table decides.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set your game plan, prepare your starting line-up, then adjust from the sideline as the match unfolds. Nothing is predetermined — every result is earned.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make substitutions and change tactics mid-match</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players act on their own, driven by their attributes, form, and morale</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Opponents bring their own tactics, so every match demands a different approach</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2607570/extras/c1652c9ec9bf37cf7225e27141f7b30e.poster.avif?t=1780324963\" width=1170 height=420 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2607570/extras/c1652c9ec9bf37cf7225e27141f7b30e.webm?t=1780324963\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2607570/extras/c1652c9ec9bf37cf7225e27141f7b30e.mp4?t=1780324963\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Players with real depth</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every player has strengths and weaknesses, both on and off the pitch. Attributes like accuracy, vision, power, speed, and composure make each player feel unique.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scout the transfer market for wonderkids from different countries</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sign players with the right traits and strengths for your squad</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build chemistry between the players you sign</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2607570/extras/18df219aca1db8bfa5e0498b8a4e9156.poster.avif?t=1780324963\" width=1170 height=520 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.st